  "title": "Vertiv expands North American production capacity with new infrastructure solutions manufacturing facility",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced a major expansion of its North American manufacturing operations with a new facility in Pelzer, South Carolina. The Vertiv Pelzer facility adds 215,000 square feet (about 20,000 square meters) of manufacturing space and is projected to create up to 300 additional skilled job opportunities at this location.",
